              q: "What is the dual blood supply of the Liver?",
              a: "1. <b>Portal Vein (75%):</b> Nutrient-rich, oxygen-poor.<br>2. <b>Hepatic Artery (25%):</b> Oxygen-rich.<br><i>Both enter via the Porta Hepatis.</i>"
