              a: "• <b>Cullen’s:</b> Periumbilical bruising.<br>• <b>Grey Turner’s:</b> Flank (side) bruising.<br><i>Note: Both indicate severe necrotizing pancreatitis with retroperitoneal hemorrhage.</i>"
